[Music]  Google opens a new cloud region in the  Netherlands what does that mean and why  are we so proud of that  I'm Matt feigl and when I'm not working  on the Google wind project to guarantee  sunny skies my team helps companies in  the Netherlands learn how to use Google  cloud let's start with the question of  what a region means in the first place  with this opening Google cloud platform  products are now offered and hosted from  the Netherlands that makes us the 14th  Google cloud region in the world so here  on the spot where Google's transatlantic  cable enters Europe we now have a  state-of-the-art data center that houses  our Google cloud platform products the  great thing is our Netherlands data  center is one of the largest and most  efficient data centers in the world  everything you need to set up your cloud  and make it scalable you will find here  from compute to big data storage and  networking we are especially proud of  this location because it is all about  green energy together with an ACO we  have invested in a wind farm that  supplies the energy for this data center  making it completely co2 neutral for our  customers this means better performance  lower latency and more flexibility you  can choose to allocate your applications  or storage environment in one place or  spread them over multiple locations in  the Netherlands we have so many great  local customers like Bolcom no personal  message bird we're online blend 'el and  Philips you to name a few take philips  Lighting for example it's incredibly  important that the hue Pat form works as  quickly as possible  if you switch your light on or off video  it's important that your light responds  right away because Phillip lighting runs  the entire back-end on our cloud  platform the users see great performance  even if the signal goes all the way back  to your lamp via satellite  for me the most important reason to open  a region in the Netherlands is because  we are here for the long term here at  Google we are serious about the cloud  business and now we are your new  neighbor  right here right next door consider this  an invitation feel free to reach out or  even visit us about how we can help you  to use Google cloud talk to you soon  [Music]

